Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:10.56,Default,Sukmin,0,0,0,,Did we really need to bother \Nwith all this, Mr. Dongsuk?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:12.74,Default,Sukmin,0,0,0,,We could've just killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:15.35,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,What are you, dense?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:19.21,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,We fight in there, and the spider \Nwakes up? No more mana crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:22.56,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I don't care if he's the \Nweakest or the bleakest,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:25.81,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,there's no way that wimpy piece of crap \Nand a D-Rank with no raid experience
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:27.42,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,can take a boss down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:32.42,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,The spider eats them, it goes back to sleep, \Nand then we haul out the mana crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:35.18,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Should I light the place up with magic again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:37.76,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,That would also wake the spider up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:43.63,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,There were side tunnels near the ceiling. \NThat's where we'll drop back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:47.73,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,I get it. Nice plan, Mr. Dongsuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.73,0:00:49.58,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,You think it'll be asleep, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.58,0:00:52.91,Default,Hwang Dongusk,0,0,0,,If not, we'll have to take \Nthe boss down ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.91,0:00:56.96,Default,Hwang Dongusk,0,0,0,,Though, that Yoo Jinho kid... \NYou saw his gear, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:59.73,Default,Hwang Dongusk,0,0,0,,The sword and shield alone must \Nbe worth hundreds of millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.73,0:01:03.92,Default,Hwang Dongusk,0,0,0,,If we can't grab enough mana crystals, \Nhis stuff will have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.47,0:01:07.52,Default,Hwang Dongusk,0,0,0,,Better find out whose trust fund kid he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:10.20,Default,Hwang Dongusk,0,0,0,,It'd look bad if I didn't show at the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:14.59,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Gotta say, that was a hell of a noise \Nwhen the entrance caved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:17.14,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,The boss has gotta be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.75,0:01:21.98,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Kyuhwan, do you think you could take \Nthat nasty bastard down yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:24.75,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.75,0:01:29.19,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I'm right there with you. \NIt was a pretty impressive boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.21,0:01:37.54,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Which means those two little twerps \Nhave absolutely no chance of surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.09,0:01:42.24,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Hang on! You'd need to be at least B-Rank \Nto take down a C-Rank boss by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:45.44,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Or an upper C-Rank, at the very minimum!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.14,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,You've got no chance, Jinwoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:50.26,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Let's try and find a way out instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:57.97,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Jinho is right. I may have reawakened \Nand leveled up, but I'm still weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:02:03.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The Blue Venom-Fanged Kasaka I ran into \Nin the instance dungeon was probably D-Rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:07.82,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,and that golem boss was \Nprobably D-Rank or lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:14.00,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This boss is guaranteed to be \Na lot stronger than either of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:20.04,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But for some reason... I don't feel\Nintimidated enough to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:25.67,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've gotten strong enough to stand \Nmy ground against a C-Rank boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:29.34,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm level 18 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:33.59,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Taking on a C-Rank boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:37.26,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,is worth a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.17,0:02:44.89,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,We're called hunters for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.09,0:02:48.68,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And the real hunt begins now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:29.68,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Another long day, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:32.96,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,The government, the media,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.98,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,organizations related to energy development...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:38.47,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,These nonstop meetings \Nare beginning to wear on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:42.91,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,I was never much of a talker \Nin the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:49.78,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Your schedule is clear for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.31,0:04:54.19,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if I asked \Nfor a bit of instruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.55,0:04:57.40,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,It might be the change of pace you need, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.35,0:05:02.92,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,They say old soldiers fade away...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:07.48,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,but I can hardly turn down a youngster \Nasking for a spot of guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:18.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Its exoskeleton is so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:25.51,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And it strikes with tremendous power! \NOne false move, and I'm dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.07,0:05:35.44,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,The way he's moving... No way is he E-Rank!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:38.15,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Wh-What in the world is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:42.49,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Wait... Did he fake his ranking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.97,0:05:44.75,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I've heard the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.75,0:05:49.39,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Rare individuals can control their magic \Npower to register with a lower ranking—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:52.20,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,the hunters known as false rankers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.86,0:05:57.70,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,And most of them are said to be \Nlunatics who kill for the fun of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:03.65,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.65,0:06:05.62,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,D-Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:14.61,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Damn! Its exterior is too tough \Nfor me to do any real damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.03,0:06:19.65,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And if my fatigue gets any higher, \NI'll start to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:22.61,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I need to kill it before that happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:28.03,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Paralysis and drain... This dagger's \Nspecial abilities will be the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:30.49,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I aim for a weak spot, \Nit should get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:31.70,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:40.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Acid?! That's a nasty surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.27,0:06:43.13,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Rock-solid armor and acidic spit...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:45.68,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This eight-legged freak \Nis even worse than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:48.89,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And the longer this goes on, \Nthe worse off I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.78,0:06:52.81,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I need to get up close, \Nregardless of the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:55.15,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,My new skill, Dash...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:58.40,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can use this to get in, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:16.10,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If one hit won't cut it, then I'll keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:19.59,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,S-So fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:22.13,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,But will he have enough \Nstamina to hang in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.99,0:07:24.80,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,What is he even trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:28.47,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Faster...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.23,0:07:31.88,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I have to go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:35.81,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:41.93,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.18,0:08:01.29,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:51.56,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's a good thing I sat on \Nthose daily quest rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:54.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I would've had more trouble otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:58.73,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I can't believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:01.31,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,He really did beat a boss by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.59,0:09:07.11,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,And there can be no other explanation! \NHe's a false ranker!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:10.54,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I wonder how much this'll go for...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:14.07,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,U-Um... B-Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:18.02,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Would you like me to carry \Nthe essence stone for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:20.71,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I'll handle the gear, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:24.65,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Here's some water. \NPlease help yourself, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.65,0:09:26.14,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,U-Uh... Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:28.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Why is he calling me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:33.36,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,You rest up, boss! \NI'll excavate the mana crystals!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:37.41,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What the heck's gotten into him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:41.48,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,Huh... They're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.67,0:10:03.23,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.23,0:10:06.21,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Thank you for the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.55,0:10:09.56,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,I should be thanking you. \NThis really was just what I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:11.42,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:15.61,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,I'm impressed, Chairman. \NYou don't seem to have lost a step.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:19.39,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,No, compared to when I was on active duty...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.07,0:10:23.23,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,You've gotten better \Nat defense yourself, Jinchul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.23,0:10:25.13,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,It shows you've kept up your practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:27.14,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Training might not raise your rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:30.73,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,but you can always hone \Nyour body and technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:34.35,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,It's important to work \Non one's body and mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.35,0:10:37.19,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,instead of relying solely \Non your hunter powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:41.06,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Especially if you regularly find yourself \Nin extreme situations like dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.73,0:10:48.09,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,It's at times like those when human nature \Ncan rear its ugly head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:50.39,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,Is the freaking boss dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.39,0:10:53.80,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,I guess it was just an overgrown spider? \NWhat a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:57.57,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,Maybe that gear was enough \Nto beat a C-Rank boss with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:11:01.52,Default,Goo Juntae,0,0,0,,But in the hands of a D-Rank... \NJust how weak was this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:04.00,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,What's the call, Mr. Dongsuk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.73,Default,Hwang Dongusk,0,0,0,,Ain't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:07.08,Default,Hwang Dongusk,0,0,0,,Yoo Jinho!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:11.78,Default,Hwang Dongusk,0,0,0,,That fancy gear of yours got me curious, \Nand I'm impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:17.07,Default,Hwang Dongusk,0,0,0,,Your old man's Yoo Myunghan, \Nthe head of Yoojin Construction, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:19.93,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Wh-What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.93,0:11:21.88,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I'm giving you a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:24.33,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Kill Sung Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.05,0:11:27.91,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,You've figured it out by now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.91,0:11:33.13,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,We pick up wastes of space to round out our \Nnumbers, let them die, and keep all the loot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:36.61,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Jinho. You're gonna be an accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:38.59,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,That's the only way you're walking out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:40.01,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.37,0:11:44.52,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,That trust fund kid's gear was \Nenough to take down a C-Rank...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:46.63,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,If it has special effects, \Nit could be a real pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.28,0:11:51.02,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Or if you'd prefer, you can both die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:55.21,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,What's up? Why hesitate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:58.16,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Nothing that happens here \Nis ever going to get out, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:12:01.96,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Don't tell me a D-Rank like you \Nis afraid of an E-Rank like him...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:24.68,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,So you're siding with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:30.15,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,What now, Mr. Dongsuk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:31.97,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Deal with the weak one first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:34.04,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Have you boys...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:38.15,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,ever killed a human before?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.95,0:12:44.53,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,An urgent quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:46.68,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.41,0:12:50.67,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,You're gonna wanna pay attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.29,0:12:59.40,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.14,0:13:06.46,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,Heejin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:11.81,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:14.80,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,How have things been with \Nthe White Tiger Guild lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:17.93,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Nothing special, really. \NJust the usual business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.93,0:13:20.12,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,What about the Hunters Guild, Gina?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:22.88,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,Same for us, really. Just normal stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:28.27,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,You mentioned you were going to start \NA-Rank dungeon training with Ms. Cha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.27,0:13:29.75,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,How'd that go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:31.42,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,It was really something...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:32.92,Default,Lee Bora,0,0,0,,Something fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:36.64,Default,Lee Bora,0,0,0,,We were all struggling against \Nan A-Rank beast...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.43,0:13:43.39,Default,Lee Bora,0,0,0,,But she defeated it in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.39,0:13:47.22,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,She made it look extremely easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:52.18,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,We were all pretty surprised, \Nbut Kihoon was completely bowled over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.20,0:13:56.42,Default,Lee Bora,0,0,0,,He'd been hoping to become the next \Nstrike team captain, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:13:58.33,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,He is pretty straight-laced, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:14:00.51,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,What about Chul in your guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.51,0:14:03.25,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,He's after the same kind of position, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:06.14,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,He's... not a bad guy or anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:08.98,Default,Lee Bora,0,0,0,,The fact that you said it \Nlike that tells us everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.41,0:14:12.87,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,Well, be that as it may, we're pretty lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:17.36,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,The Hunters Guild and the White Tiger Guild...\NWe're in the big leagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:18.81,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,You've got a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.84,0:14:24.31,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,You hear plenty of unsavory rumors \Nabout a lot of places out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:26.25,Default,Park Heejin,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:31.01,Default,Gina,0,0,0,,Strike teams with suspiciously \Nhigh fatality rates, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.35,0:14:37.19,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Yoo Jinho! He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.03,0:14:40.44,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,How could you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:45.12,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How could I have forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:49.03,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I work in a world where survival \Nof the fittest is the reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.59,0:14:53.20,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A world filled with violence, \Ndeception, and betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:55.40,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How could I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:14:58.71,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How? How? How...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:04.51,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How? How? How? How?! How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:08.68,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's it. I'd grown numb to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:13.57,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Carelessness. Overconfidence. Delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.07,0:15:17.44,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Enemies...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:21.30,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The system is telling me to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.47,0:15:25.04,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Does it need to keep me alive \Nfor some reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.59,0:15:29.25,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This isn't a coincidence. It's not charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.56,0:15:33.40,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The system wants me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:39.72,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It wants me strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.89,0:15:42.75,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Boss! Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:45.58,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,Dude, he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.47,0:15:49.16,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:56.40,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If the system wants to use me, \Nthen I'll use it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.98,0:15:59.79,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Damn it, Kyuhwan. Don't hold back so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:02.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'd forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:07.61,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The weak always get taken from. \NThat's how it works here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.61,0:16:12.03,Default,Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Hey, look! The Weakest Hunter \Nof All Mankind actually gets it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.63,0:16:17.32,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That means you guys understand \Nhow it works, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:20.28,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,How what works?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:22.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If you're hunters...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:27.84,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,then you're ready to be \Npreyed on yourselves, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:32.01,Default,Goo Juntae,0,0,0,,Let me handle this, Mr. Dongsuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:36.47,Default,Goo Juntae,0,0,0,,Look, buddy. You clearly don't \Nunderstand what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:38.97,Default,Goo Juntae,0,0,0,,We should be ready to be preyed on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.97,0:16:42.47,Default,Goo Juntae,0,0,0,,And what's a jumped-up \NE-Rank like you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.47,0:16:44.69,Default,Goo Juntae,0,0,0,,The Weakest Hunter of All—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.13,0:16:58.31,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,One down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.31,0:16:59.85,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,J-Juntae!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:01.00,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.00,0:17:02.79,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,When did he draw that weapon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:04.96,Default,Sukmin,0,0,0,,Where was he even hiding it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:07.61,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Overconfidence aside, Juntae was D-Rank!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:10.20,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,How could an E-Rank manage to kill him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.43,0:17:15.72,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I just killed someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.07,0:17:17.28,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:20.81,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Even if I was just obeying the system,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:25.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've... just murdered another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:28.94,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But if I hadn't done it, I would've died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.85,0:17:31.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,So I can't back down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.45,0:17:36.58,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If only the strong get to survive, then...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.33,0:17:39.20,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:52.20,Default,Jinsuk,0,0,0,,How's an E-Rank got moves like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.70,0:17:54.31,Default,Lee Chul-jin,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.31,0:18:00.27,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Kyuhwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:01.27,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:09.86,Default,Cho Kyuhwan,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:19.20,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,He's so strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:24.17,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,He feels stronger now than when \Nhe was fighting the dungeon boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:27.29,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,H-He took my entire team apart in seconds...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:29.88,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Was he hiding his true strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:32.52,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,You beat the boss, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:37.47,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Well, I might be a C-Rank, too, \Nbut you'll find I'm nothing like them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:39.61,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Reinforcement!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:45.91,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,This guy may be a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:50.02,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,but after fighting a boss and five hunters, \Nhe can't be at full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.32,0:18:54.32,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,The trick is in how fast he is, \Nand in his dagger's special abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:57.95,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,But when I use the Reinforcement skill, \Nmy body becomes as strong as steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:19:00.74,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,That knife of his won't affect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.09,0:19:08.92,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mr. Hwang. You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.06,0:19:12.70,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But I've got some bad news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.47,0:19:21.11,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've been leveling up this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.29,0:19:24.77,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,Wh-What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.77,0:19:27.94,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,He... He smashed me into the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.46,0:19:32.15,DefaultItalics,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell he's E-Rank!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:35.25,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,H-Hang on! Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:37.79,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,You've gotta show mercy! I-I can pay you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.79,0:19:41.70,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,The mana crystals and essence stones... \NYou can have the lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.47,0:19:45.50,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I-Is that not enough for you? \NI-In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:48.17,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,I'll pay you double! Double what I was—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.18,0:19:48.17,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.23,0:19:51.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You tried to kill me three times...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:54.67,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,and now you want mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.67,0:19:58.76,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,D-Don't do it! Y-You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:04.43,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Weren't you the one who said nothing \Nthat happens in a dungeon ever gets out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.43,0:20:09.06,Default,Hwang Dongsuk,0,0,0,,You little shit! Do you have \Nany idea who my brother—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.71,0:20:27.71,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The boss is dead, so the dungeon's closing. \NLet's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:37.92,Default,Investigator(Female),0,0,0,,You mean to tell me that all the \NC-Rank hunters died in action,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:43.50,Default,Investigator(Female),0,0,0,,and the only survivors were... \Na D-Rank and an E-Rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:46.35,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,That's true. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:48.56,Default,Investigator (female),0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:49.81,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:55.16,Default,Investigator(Female),0,0,0,,Your gear... That's the Maya Company's Kalion\NLongsword! The one that just came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:56.78,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Oh... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:20:59.62,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I got rewarded for something like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.51,0:21:01.95,DefaultTop,Investigator(female),0,0,0,,And that's Gredos's Royal Series!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:02.51,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The Murderous Intent skill...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:06.91,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It can cut all abilities in half, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:10.08,Default,Investigator(Female),0,0,0,,I see! Well, your equipment \Nexplains your survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.59,0:21:13.32,Default,Investigator(Female),0,0,0,,You must've handled everything yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.32,0:21:16.71,Default,Investigator(Female),0,0,0,,while this E-Rank probably hid to say safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:22.83,Default,Investigator(Female),0,0,0,,I appreciate your cooperation \Nafter such an ordeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.83,0:21:24.79,Default,Investigator(Female),0,0,0,,That should be everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.11,0:21:27.47,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.31,0:21:31.94,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,B-Boss... Good work back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:34.16,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.09,0:21:42.99,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.99,0:21:44.02,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I was just thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.68,0:21:49.47,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm glad I gave her that umbrella.
